TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Albite at pH 2, 200C, with H2S gas phase

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    Fe(2)     4.0  mmol/kgw
    Fe(3)     4.0  mmol/kgw
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Albite
    -m0   1.0
    -m    1.0
    -parms  1.0  10.0
    -step   10 in 100
    -tol    1e-12

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure  5.0
    -volume    1.0
    -temperature  200
    H2S(g)   5.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   albite_kinetic.out
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -kinetic_reactants  Albite

END
